# Mouse and held keys in the combat (POW_HOLD_TO_MOVE=1): walk while the button / key is held,
# click on the hero = attack, right button = attack (no turning), HUD * box = potion,
# skills from the keyboard (key 1 = slot 1)
env POW_HOLD_TO_MOVE=1
wait 25
key FIRE
wait 2
